box" id="compact-f4f1373d-1b0f-47b5-9dc5-d80b13a84acf"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Smooth Dream Product</strong> - We use sugarcane-based bio-resin tubes for our Smooth Dream product - a renewable alternative to petroleum-based plastic. These tubes are fully recyclable and help lower our carbon footprint.<br><br><strong>Mane Master&nbsp;Brush</strong>&nbsp;– Our brushes are packaged in recyclable paper, making disposal simple and eco-conscious. The brush handle is made from wood, and the bristles are ethically sourced boar hair, a renewable material.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Smooth&nbsp;Travel Brush</strong> -&nbsp;Each travel brush comes in a durable metal tin - fully reusable and perfect for storing bobby pins, hair ties, or other small accessories. It's packaging that serves a purpose long after unboxing.<br><br><strong>Smooth Silky Satin Bobbins</strong> – Our signature bobbins come in a sleek, reusable storage box - made to be kept, refilled, and reused. It's as functional as it is waste-free.<br><br><strong>Travel Gift Set&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>–&nbsp;This set features a high-quality, reusable beauty bag that’s both stylish and sustainable. Whether you're packing your routine or organizing on the go, it’s made to last far beyond the holidays.<br><br><strong>Christmas Giftsets&nbsp;Sets</strong> – All of our festive gift sets come in fully reusable packaging, including our large Smooth storage gift box - perfect for reusing at home or regifting with purpose.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-dGVrNp kIZjuh pf-73_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-deEcaK pLXxN pf-74_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="3e8c8323-7156-4dae-b5c4-7c1b6a5ca44b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12